<title>USA: BRIA acquires Kingslawn Offset Inc.</title>
<headline>BRIA acquires Kingslawn Offset Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRIA Communications Corp announced the acquisition of Kingslawn Offset In c on Wednesday for considerations totalling $2 million.</p>
<p>Kingslawn Offset, a printing company, will become a wholly-owned subsidiary of BRIA,.</p>
